sequenceDiagram
    participant Participant
    participant FAPI
    participant Consent
    participant Discovery
    participant Policy
    participant Planner
    participant Temporal

    Participant->>FAPI: POST /oauth/authorize (FAPI-Brazil)
    FAPI->>Consent: Create consent + permissions
    Consent-->>Participant: consentId + permissions
    Participant->>Consent: POST /consents/{id}/authorize
    Consent->>Discovery: Discover accessible resources
    Discovery->>Policy: Evaluate authorized resources
    Policy->>Planner: Authorized context (immutable)
    Planner->>Temporal: Execution plan (DAG)
    Temporal-->>Participant: Workflow started
